          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP485 - RR 190&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Out for another day of capping and caching with OBA, this time we went east!! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; Last one of the day as it's getting dark! Luckily the cows didn't care as we hopped over the fence and the short stakes made the cap easy to find! TFTCap!!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
